From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Hertenberger <erde74@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:22:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 15/25] plan9: i686-unknown-plan9 (386, SSE2): the target,
 std's rfork and stack switch for x86 (INT $64; the child gets its parent's
 registers)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 compiler/rustc_target/src/spec/mod.rs         |  1 +
 .../src/spec/targets/i686_unknown_plan9.rs    | 29 +++++++
 library/std/src/sys/pal/plan9/proc.rs         | 76 +++++++++++++++++++
 src/bootstrap/src/core/sanity.rs              |  1 +
 4 files changed, 107 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 compiler/rustc_target/src/spec/targets/i686_unknown_plan9.rs

diff --git a/compiler/rustc_target/src/spec/mod.rs b/compiler/rustc_target/src/spec/mod.rs
index 1c7aa8fd64d12b79d0be3c7a1f43683a60272ab9..86d525c7da504c2b30336fe8492b620169379774 100644
--- a/compiler/rustc_target/src/spec/mod.rs
+++ b/compiler/rustc_target/src/spec/mod.rs
@@ -1546,6 +1546,7 @@ supported_targets! {
     ("x86_64-unknown-hermit", x86_64_unknown_hermit),
 
     ("x86_64-unknown-plan9", x86_64_unknown_plan9),
